OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FMore than 2,000 people have died from
OL,7,FEbola in the Democratic Republic of
OL,8,FCongo, in what is now the fastest-
OL,9,Fgrowing outbreak of the disease on
OL,10,Frecord.
OL,12,FThis comes as rebel conflict, bad
OL,13,Froads, and work stoppages over payment
OL,14,Fissues are hampering relief efforts in
OL,15,Fremote parts of the country.
OL,17,FGovernment data showed the outbreak
OL,18,Fhas recorded 4,381 confirmed cases,
OL,19,Fincluding 2,011 deaths.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/8
