OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FThe death toll has risen almost three
OL,7,Ftimes faster than during the 2014-16
OL,8,FEbola outbreak in West Africa, the
OL,9,Fdeadliest on record.
OL,11,FThe current outbreak was declared on
OL,12,FMay 15, but health authorities say
OL,13,Ftesting of the virus' genetic material
OL,14,Fshows it began months earlier, in
OL,15,FFebruary.
OL,17,FIt took about nine weeks for the death
OL,18,Ftoll to reach 1,000, but just three
OL,19,Fweeks for it to double to more than
OL,20,F2,000.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
