OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786528088
OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FExperts warn the outbreak is spreading
OL,7,Ffaster than efforts to track and
OL,8,Fcontain it.
OL,10,FIn the epicentre, in DR Congo's Ituri
OL,11,Fprovince, friends and relatives
OL,12,Fgathered on Tuesday for the burial of
OL,13,F38-year-old Jeannine Katusabe, one of
OL,14,Fthe latest victims.
OL,16,FThe outbreak is already the second-
OL,17,Flargest in history, behind the 2014-16
OL,18,Foutbreak in West Africa, which
OL,19,Frecorded more than 28,000 cases and
OL,20,F11,000 deaths.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
