OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FIt has spread across five provinces in
OL,7,Feastern Congo, near the borders with
OL,8,FSouth Sudan, Uganda, and Rwanda.
OL,10,FThe current outbreak has a death rate
OL,11,Fof 45.9% among confirmed cases, higher
OL,12,Fthan the 39.6% recorded during the
OL,13,F2014-16 outbreak.
OL,15,FThis outbreak is also different from
OL,16,Fmost previous ones.
OL,18,FIt is caused by the rare Bundibugyo
OL,19,Fstrain of Ebola, for which there are
OL,20,Fno approved vaccines or treatments.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
