OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FClinical trials for both have now
OL,7,Fbegun in Ituri province.
OL,9,FAlthough the strain behind the 2014-16
OL,10,Foutbreak is considered the deadliest,
OL,11,Fgovernment figures show the current
OL,12,Foutbreak has killed a higher
OL,13,Fproportion of those infected.
OL,15,FExperts say this is partly because
OL,16,Fpatients are not receiving care
OL,17,Fquickly enough, while many people are
OL,18,Freporting symptoms late or not seeking
OL,19,Fhelp at all.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
