OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,F"In the absence of an effective
OL,7,Fvaccine, control (for the outbreak)
OL,8,Frests on identifying cases and then
OL,9,Fnursing them in secure facilities
OL,10,Funtil they recover or sadly perish,"
OL,11,FPaul Hunter, a professor of medicine
OL,12,Fat the University of East Anglia, said.
OL,14,FHe added that surveillance was
OL,15,Fparticularly difficult in remote areas
OL,16,Faffected by conflict and poor
OL,17,Fcommunications, making it "impossible"
OL,18,Fin some cases to identify people early
OL,19,Fenough to prevent the virus from
OL,20,Fspreading.
