OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,7,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,8,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,9,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,11,FAuthorities in eastern Congo have
OL,12,Frestricted public gatherings and
OL,13,Fclosed Ituri's main airport in an
OL,14,Feffort to limit the spread.
OL,16,FBut people continue to move through
OL,17,Fthe region for trade and mining, while
OL,18,Fconflict has forced many others from
OL,19,Ftheir homes.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/8
