OL,3,CEbola deaths in DR Congo surpass 2,000
OL,4,Cin fastest-growing outbreak on record
OL,6,FThe World Health Organisation on
OL,7,FMonday said some cases early in the
OL,8,Foutbreak were wrongly attributed to
OL,9,Fmalaria and typhoid, and that early
OL,10,Ftesting was conducted for the more
OL,11,Fcommon type of Ebola, delaying the
OL,12,Frealisation of what was unfolding
OL,14,FOfficials are "chasing the virus; the
OL,15,Fvirus is ahead of us," the WHO
OL,16,Fregional director for Africa, Dr
OL,17,FMohamed Yakub Janabi, told a news
OL,18,Fconference.
